  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the donabe pot and set it over medium heat on the stovetop.",
    "Add the quinoa and toast for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally, until lightly browned and fragrant.",
    "Add the chickpeas, hot smoked paprika, chorizo, red onion, red bell pepper, garlic, and cilantro to the donabe pot.",
    "Stir to combine and cook for 5 minutes, until the vegetables are slightly tender.",
    "Transfer the donabe pot to the preheated oven and roast for 20-25 minutes, until the quinoa is cooked and the vegetables are tender.",
    "Remove the donabe pot from the oven and stir in the lime juice and olive oil.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired."
  ],
